  "segments": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's been months. I make dua every single night... and nothing changes. Is Allah even listening to me?",
      "kicker": "HIM",
      "voiceId": "yJSTU8D97YocC6Dqg20L",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.42,
        "style": 0.38,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.95
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Can I tell you what the Prophet, peace be upon him, taught about exactly that? Not one of those prayers was wasted. Not a single one.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then why has nothing changed?",
      "kicker": "HIM",
      "voiceId": "yJSTU8D97YocC6Dqg20L",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.42,
        "style": 0.38,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.95
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Because an answer is not always a yes, today. He taught that every prayer, free of sin and of cutting family ties, is answered in one of three ways. Sometimes Allah gives you what you asked for, quickly.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "foot": "Musnad Ahmad 11133 (hasan)",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sometimes He stores it for you in the next life. A treasure, waiting for you.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And sometimes, He quietly turns away a harm that was coming for you. One you never even knew about.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png",
      "holdSeconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But it feels like silence.",
      "kicker": "HIM",
      "voiceId": "yJSTU8D97YocC6Dqg20L",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.42,
        "style": 0.38,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.95
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then listen to what Allah Himself says about the one who calls on Him.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png",
      "holdSeconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And when My servants ask you concerning Me, indeed I am near. I respond to the invocation of the supplicant when he calls upon Me.",
      "quote": "2:186",
      "foot": "Qur'an 2:186 - Saheeh International",
      "kicker": "THE QUR'AN SAYS",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.6,
        "style": 0.18,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.9
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png",
      "holdSeconds": 1.4
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Near...",
      "kicker": "HIM",
      "voiceId": "yJSTU8D97YocC6Dqg20L",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "style": 0.32,
        "similarity_boost": 0.9,
        "speed": 0.95
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nearer than the silence. A prophet once called out from inside a whale, in darkness beneath darkness, at the bottom of the sea. And the answer still reached him.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "foot": "Qur'an 21:87-88",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "So keep asking. The prayer you are tired of repeating may be the very thing standing between you and what you could not survive.",
      "kicker": "THE ELDER",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.55,
        "style": 0.25,
        "similarity_boost": 0.85,
        "speed": 0.93
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png",
      "holdSeconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then I will keep asking.",
      "kicker": "HIM",
      "voiceId": "yJSTU8D97YocC6Dqg20L",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "style": 0.32,
        "similarity_boost": 0.9,
        "speed": 0.95
      },
      "image": "main/dua-listening.png",
      "holdSeconds": 1.6
    }
  ]
